motion-command-toggle = Toggle persistent reduced motion
motion-command-off = Keep all motion static, persistently
motion-command-on = Allow optional motion, persistently
motion-reduced = Reduced motion selected; saving locally. All activity stays static. /motion-on allows motion.
motion-allowed = Optional motion selected; saving locally. /motion-off keeps all activity static.
motion-saved-override = Motion preference selected; saving locally for future launches. This launch's explicit --animation / --no-animation override remains active.
